- `hardest tasks`: {{model:hardest tasks}}
- `how explorer`: {{model:how explorer}}
- `how explainer`: {{model:how explainer}}
- `why investigators`: {{model:why investigators}}
- `why synthesizer`: {{model:why synthesizer}}
- `reflect tooling`: {{model:reflect tooling}}
- `reflect judgment, divergent, synthesizer`: {{model:reflect judgment, divergent, synthesizer}}
- `arena runners`: {{model:arena runners}}
- `arena cross-judge pool`: {{model:arena cross-judge pool}}
- `swarm workers`: {{model:swarm workers}}
- `architect runners`: {{model:architect runners}}
- `interrogate reviewers`: {{model:interrogate reviewers}}

